    {
      "stage": "overview",
      "id": 23,
      "profile": {
        "title": "League of Tuonela",
        "summary": "League of Tuonela holds 45 districts and 2 towns, home to 251,978 residents. Its capital is Wildcombe. Its dry-land territory ranks 1 among living realms and covers 6.6% of the world's dry land.",
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "Origins and identity",
            "text": "The realm was founded in year 400. Its current government is a city-state league with prosperity as its governing priority. Its name draws on Finnish mythology: Tuonela, the realm of the dead."
          },
          {
            "title": "Land and climate",
            "text": "Its holdings lie on Vaelthar. The largest landscapes are cold desert (36.1% of its dry land) and tundra (18.3% of its dry land). Temperatures across that land range from -13 to 24.1 °C. Its lands are generally semi-arid. 14 districts reach the sea and 5 districts border inland lakes."
          },
          {
            "title": "Peoples and faiths",
            "text": "Among its residents, the population includes Humans (36%), Hornkin (23.8%), Stonekin (12.4%), and other communities (27.8%). Veil of Stars is the state tradition; that designation does not determine each resident's belief. The resident faiths are Veil of Stars (31.1%), Rootbound Covenant (22.4%), Dawn Communion (16.3%), and other communities (30.2%)."
          },
          {
            "title": "Hinterland and exchange",
            "text": "Food supplies exceed current needs, covering 180.3% of demand. Limited fertile land constrains farming. Woodland covers roughly 2.3% of provincial land. It has moderate mineral resources. Trade agreements connect it with Caer Sidi, Midgard, Pohjola, and Tamoanchan. Annual revenue is 3.8 treasury units, including 0.6 from trade; reserves stand at 8.3."
          },
          {
            "title": "Power and diplomacy",
            "text": "Its field army numbers 3.6 thousand, supported by 8.3 naval flotillas. Its arcane institutions have reached level 0.98. Defensive allies are Caer Sidi. It is not involved in any recorded active war."
          }
        ],
        "facts": {
          "area": 1118.1479803323746,
          "areaShare": 0.06607709480848925,
          "areaRank": 1,
          "provinceCount": 45,
          "townCount": 2,
          "population": 251977.61425113142,
          "capital": "Wildcombe"
        },
        "events": [
          {
            "year": 400,
            "type": "founding",
            "text": "League of Tuonela forms around Wildcombe, holding 45 connected districts. Other local centers remain sovereign."
          }
        ]
      }
